<title>SHARJAH: SOCCER-UAE BEAT BAHRAIN 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UAE BEAT BAHRAIN 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>United</p>
<p>Arab Emirates beat Bahrain 3-0 (halftime 1-0) in a World Cup</p>
<p>soccer Asian zone group 3 qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Hassan Sohail 14, Khamis Saad 49, 60</p>
</text>
